  "description": "The ASP.NET Core host of Elarion's WebDAV core (ADR-0111): MapElarionDav() maps one route group under the DAV prefix for every registered protocol (CalDAV, feeds) with the WebDAV methods, requires the app-password scheme (or the schemes the host names) so a browser session never drives DAV and an app password reaches no other endpoint, seeds the dispatch scope with the DAV principal after authentication, exempts the routes from cross-origin protection, and redirects /.well-known/caldav to the prefix. Plain request delegates, no reflection.",
